# CocoaPods. This SDK no longer publishes a pod: trunk goes permanently read-only on
# 2 December 2026, and the last published pod was 5.0.1. Consumers use Swift Package
# Manager, the framework, or the static lib in Library/.
*.podspec

# macOS Finder metadata. A stray .DS_Store inside a bundle changes its checksum for no
# reason, and three of them once shipped inside the 5.0.1 release asset.
.DS_Store

# Release assets are attached to the GitHub Release, never committed.
*.zip

# SwiftPM build products, if anyone resolves something in here.
.build/
